 "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun a Rat</strong> は、友達と一緒に楽しめるスピーディーでスリリングな非対称型マルチプレイヤーゲームです。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ネズミ</strong>となって家中を荒らしまわるか... それとも<strong>害獣駆除業者</strong>となってネズミを一匹残らず駆除するか！<br>2人から最大20人までのマッチに参加し、驚きに満ちた多様なマップで対戦しましょう…</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>一風変わったボイスチャット...</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ネズミ</strong>同士はボイスチャットで会話できますが、内容がばれる心配はありません。</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>害獣駆除業者</strong>には、人間の言葉ではなく「チューチュー」という鳴き声にしか聞こえないのです！</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/631dfbf1331d4b6f28ab71b62fa426e7.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ネズミとしての目標：</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >やられることなく制限時間内に家具を破壊したり盗んだりして、目標スコアに到達しましょう！</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ただしご注意を... 何かを破壊するたびに音が発生し、居場所がばれてしまいます！</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/785ff52c6008d4641427841beaf273d5.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >もし<strong>害獣駆除業者</strong>に追われたら、<br>家具の中に素早く隠れて追跡を振り切りましょう。</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/c24aeb33818dfee17e33f2e12fffb523.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>害獣駆除業者として：</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>防犯カメラ</strong>を使ってネズミの動きを追跡し、隠れ場所を突き止めましょう...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>トラップ</strong>を計画的に配置して、ネズミの足を可能な限り引っ張りましょう</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >一匹残らず<strong>駆除</strong>しましょう！</p></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/0aec956a33897aeefeebc9c4f42e2507.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >豊富な種類のトラップが用意されており、<br>それぞれが<strong>ネズミ</strong>たちに嫌なサプライズをもたらします...</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/53d85907a7ae08ab350d2db6bead0b26.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >試合を重ねて<strong>チーズコイン</strong>を獲得し、<br>スキンを購入して自分のネズミをカスタマイズしましょう！</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.poster.avif?t=1789055885\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.webm?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163660/extras/75ed8cf51785b3628cf0fc2842804f8e.mp4?t=1789055885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>さあ、あなたはどちらの陣营で戦いますか？</strong></p></p>",
